T:Waltz in A-flat major
C:Johannes Brahms
O:Op. 39 No. 15
N:Transposed down a semitone from A-flat major to G major, so the high B-flat
N:in bars 20-21 stays on A5. The melody is the flutetunes.com MIDI up to the
N:octave-higher return, which is left out. The grace notes in bars 3 and 11 are omitted.
N:Chords derived from the melody.
